      "body": "## Summary\n\nFix a Python syntax error in the Pipeline Parallelism code example in `docs/configuration/optimization.md`.\n\nThe `model` argument string was missing its closing quote, making the snippet invalid Python:\n\n**Before:**\n```python\nllm = LLM(\n    model=\"meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct,\n    tensor_parallel_size=4,\n    pipeline_parallel_size=2,\n)\n```\n\n**After:**\n```python\nllm = LLM(\n    model=\"meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct\",\n    tensor_parallel_size=4,\n    pipeline_parallel_size=2,\n)\n```\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Verified the corrected snippet is valid Python syntax\n- [x] No other changes made\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
